DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nCPF Schemes and Retirement Planning Strategies\nSynop
	sis\n:\nHear from the experts on how CPF schemes work for your future and 
	uncover tips and strategies to optimise your retirement plans.\n- Myths an
	d misconceptions about CPF \n- How can we rely on CPF schemes to better pl
	an for our retirement?\n- Strategies to grow your CPF funds\, prepare for 
	your retirement\, and utilize CPF into your golden years.\nSpeaker\n:\nLor
	na Beng Choo TAN\nMs Joanne Tan\, Director for Outreach and Partnership\, 
	CPFB\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n \nDBS Asia East/Asia West Audito
	rium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Sin
	gapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a firs
	t time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex
	 Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/pers
	onal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=S
	zBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from
	 DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of t
	he event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.co
	m/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e7716564ccfe56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter you
	r First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJo
	in via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store 
	or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 68
	6 5933\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  
	+65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-2
	2-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMee
	ting Number:  2510 686 5933\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com
	/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e8b348588cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n 
	\n
